{{define "content"}}
<h1>Stations</h1>
{{if .ShowOnboarding}}
<section style="margin: 16px 0 24px 0; padding: 16px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d8e0eb;">
  <h2>Quick Setup / 快速配置</h2>
  <p>Start the gateway locally, then open the admin page and add your first relay station. / 先在本地启动网关，然后打开管理页面并添加第一个中转站。</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong>Step 1 / 第一步</strong><br>
      Gateway default address: <code>http://{{.DefaultListenAddr}}</code><br>
      网关默认地址：<code>http://{{.DefaultListenAddr}}</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Step 2 / 第二步</strong><br>
      Fill one station with OpenAI settings, Anthropic settings, or both. / 为一个站点填写 OpenAI 配置、Anthropic 配置，或同时填写两者。<br>
      OpenAI base URL example: <code>{{.ExampleOpenAIBaseURL}}</code><br>
      Anthropic base URL example: <code>{{.ExampleAnthropicBaseURL}}</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Step 3 / 第三步</strong><br>
      After saving the station, create model mappings under Mappings. / 保存站点后，到 Mappings 页面建立模型映射。<br>
      OpenAI alias example: <code>{{.ExampleOpenAIAlias}}</code> -> <code>{{.ExampleOpenAIModel}}</code><br>
      Anthropic alias example: <code>{{.ExampleAnthropicAlias}}</code> -> <code>{{.ExampleAnthropicModel}}</code>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
{{end}}
{{if .EditStation}}
<p>Editing station: <strong>{{.EditStation.Name}}</strong> / 正在编辑站点：<strong>{{.EditStation.Name}}</strong></p>
{{end}}
<form method="post" action="{{if .EditStation}}/admin/stations/update{{else}}/admin/stations{{end}}" style="margin: 16px 0 24px 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; max-width: 960px;">
  <input type="hidden" name="write_token" value="{{.WriteToken}}">
  {{if .EditStation}}<input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{.EditStation.ID}}">{{end}}
  <input name="name" placeholder="Station name" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.Name}}{{end}}" required>
  <label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" {{if .EditStation}}{{if .EditStation.Enabled}}checked{{end}}{{else}}checked{{end}}> Enabled</label>
  <input name="priority" type="number" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.Priority}}{{else}}10{{end}}" placeholder="Priority">
  <input name="cooldown_seconds" type="number" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.CooldownSeconds}}{{else}}30{{end}}" placeholder="Cooldown seconds">
  <input name="health_check_interval_seconds" type="number" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.HealthCheckIntervalSeconds}}{{else}}15{{end}}" placeholder="Health interval seconds">
  <input name="health_check_timeout_seconds" type="number" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.HealthCheckTimeoutSeconds}}{{else}}5{{end}}" placeholder="Health timeout seconds">
  <input name="consecutive_failure_threshold" type="number" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.ConsecutiveFailureThreshold}}{{else}}1{{end}}" placeholder="Failure threshold">
  <input name="consecutive_recovery_threshold" type="number" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.ConsecutiveRecoveryThreshold}}{{else}}2{{end}}" placeholder="Recovery threshold">
  <input name="openai_base_url" placeholder="OpenAI base URL" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.OpenAIBaseURL}}{{end}}">
  <input name="openai_api_key" placeholder="OpenAI API key" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.OpenAIAPIKey}}{{end}}">
  <input name="anthropic_base_url" placeholder="Anthropic base URL" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.AnthropicBaseURL}}{{end}}">
  <input name="anthropic_api_key" placeholder="Anthropic API key" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.AnthropicAPIKey}}{{end}}">
  <p style="margin: 0; color: #51606f;">Configure OpenAI, Anthropic, or both. For each protocol, base URL and key must be filled together. / 可只配置 OpenAI、Anthropic，或两者同时配置。每种协议都必须同时填写 base URL 和 key。</p>
  <button type="submit">{{if .EditStation}}Update Station{{else}}Save Station{{end}}</button>
</form>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Name</th>
      <th>Enabled</th>
      <th>Priority</th>
      <th>OpenAI Base URL</th>
      <th>Anthropic Base URL</th>
      <th>Actions</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {{range .Stations}}
    <tr>
      <td>{{.Name}}</td>
      <td>{{.Enabled}}</td>
      <td>{{.Priority}}</td>
      <td>{{.OpenAIBaseURL}}</td>
      <td>{{.AnthropicBaseURL}}</td>
      <td><a href="/admin/stations/edit?id={{.ID}}">Edit</a></td>
    </tr>
    {{else}}
    <tr>
      <td colspan="6">No stations configured yet.</td>
    </tr>
    {{end}}
  </tbody>
</table>
{{end}}
